@startuml
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  BorderColor #333333
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
hide empty description

title hotel_verification_request.status
[*] --> PENDING : partner submits (INITIAL or UPDATE)
[*] --> NEEDS_REVISION : manager asks an active hotel to verify again (RENEWAL)
PENDING --> APPROVED : manager approves
PENDING --> REJECTED : manager rejects with a reason
PENDING --> NEEDS_REVISION : manager asks for changes
APPROVED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
NEEDS_REVISION --> [*]
legend bottom
A request is never reopened: after REJECTED or NEEDS_REVISION the partner submits a new request.
Dashed arrow: planned, not implemented yet.
endlegend
@enduml